            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Travel Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出门就有轨迹，不用操心。手机不动时定位自动休眠，在一个地方待久了会完全关闭 GPS。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your routes are recorded without a thought. Location rests when your phone is still, and GPS turns off completely once you've settled somewhere."
          }
