      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出点汗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Work up a sweat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "看老东西": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Old things"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "人间烟火": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Street life"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是你亲手收进想去清单的地方。它等你很久了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You put this on your wish list yourself. It's been waiting."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你的卡包里有一张%@签证，到%@都有效。别让它白白等着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You have a %1$@ visa in your wallet, valid until %2$@. Don't let it sit there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你说想放空。这里有足够大的风景，装得下你的心事。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You wanted to switch off. There's enough scenery here to hold whatever's on your mind."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你说想出点汗。走到这里，脑子就安静了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You wanted to work up a sweat. By the time you get here, your head will be quiet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你想看老东西。这里的时间，比所有烦恼都长。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You wanted old things. Time here runs longer than any worry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你想要点人间烟火。那就去热闹里走走。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You wanted some street life. Go and walk through it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你说都行。那这次，就听盲盒的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You said anything. So this time, the box decides."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离你只有 %@，可你还从没来过。最近的远方，常常就在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only %@ away, and you've never been. Far away is often this close."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有 %@，一个周末刚刚好。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only %@ away. Just right for a weekend."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这里比你到过最远的地方，还要再远 %@。该刷新一下纪录了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ further than you've ever been. Time for a new record."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你点亮了 %lld 处地方，里面还没有一座山。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit %lld places, and not one is a mountain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你点亮了 %lld 处地方，里面还没有一片水。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit %lld places, and not one is by the water."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你点亮了 %lld 处地方，里面还没有一处古迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit %lld places, and not one is a historic site."
