          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit %lld places, and not one is wild."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你点亮最多的是山。这一座，大概也会喜欢你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit more mountains than anything. This one should suit you too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你点亮最多的是水。这里的水，你应该也会喜欢。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You've lit more waters than anything. You should like these too."
          }
