    },
    "没关系，想去的心情可以变。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That's fine. Where you want to go can change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不知道去哪儿？这次让它替你选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don't know where to go? Let it choose this time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "有 %lld 张登机牌在等你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld boarding pass waiting for you"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld boarding passes waiting for you"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盲盒兑现": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blind Box Fulfilled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "刚拆开的盲盒，当天就走到了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opened and reached in the same day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 天前，盲盒把这里交给了你。\n你真的来了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld day ago, the box gave you this place.\nAnd you really came."
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld days ago, the box gave you this place.\nAnd you really came."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你收下的那张登机牌，今天用上了：%@。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The boarding pass you kept got used today: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "绕着水边慢慢走一圈，不用赶。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Walk slowly around the water. No hurry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "带块野餐垫，找片草地坐一下午。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bring a picnic blanket and give it the afternoon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "日落前一小时到，水面最好看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrive an hour before sunset, when the water looks its best."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "早点上山，人少，空气也好。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start early, while it's quiet and the air is fresh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不用登顶，走到舒服的地方就够了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You don't need the summit. Stop wherever feels right."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "带点吃的，在山上吃什么都香。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bring food. Everything tastes better up there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机调成静音，听一会儿风。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Silence your phone and listen to the wind for a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "穿双好走的鞋，往人少的地方多走几步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wear good shoes and walk a little further than most people do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "留到天黑，抬头看看星星。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stay until dark and look up at the stars."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找个角落坐下，想想几百年前这里的人在做什么。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sit in a corner and imagine who was here centuries ago."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "别跳过讲解牌，一个小故事就够记很久。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read the signs. One small story can stay with you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "早点到，或者晚点走，就能躲开人潮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Come early or leave late to miss the crowds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先不看攻略，拐进第一条让你好奇的小巷。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Forget the guide and turn down the first lane that makes you curious."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "问问路边的店家，他们自己常去哪家吃。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask a shopkeeper where they eat themselves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找家老店坐坐，看街上的人来人往。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sit in an old shop and watch the street go by."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拍一张只有你知道在哪儿的照片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Take a photo only you could place."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "带一样这里才有的小东西回家。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bring home one small thing you can only get here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "给很久没联系的人寄一张明信片。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send a postcard to someone you haven't spoken to in a while."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "记下今天听到的最有意思的一句话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write down the best thing you hear today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "吃一样你从没吃过的东西。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eat something you've never eaten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "到了可以这样玩": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once you're there"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的小任务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A small mission"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出发前，看一眼当地的天气和开放时间。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before you go, check the weather and opening hours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "展开全部 %lld 张": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show all %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收起照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show less"
          }
        }
      }
