    "地面上的路程相当于绕赤道 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the ground, that's %@ of the way around the equator"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "均衡": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "均衡：移动时记录完整路线，静止时自动暂停定位。适合大多数人。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Balanced: records your full route while you move and pauses location while you're still. Right for most people."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "均速": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avg Speed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "城市": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cities"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "城市和国家正在后台识别，几分钟内会陆续点亮。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
