    "套章": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果你允许，App 会读取“健康”中的步数和步行距离，以及设备的运动状态（步行、骑行、乘车），只用于在 App 内展示统计。这些数据不会被写入“健康”，也不会离开你的设备和 iCloud。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you allow it, the app reads steps and walking distance from Health, and your device's motion activity (walking, cycling, driving), only to show statistics in the app. Nothing is written to Health, and the data never leaves your devices and iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果你对隐私有任何疑问，请通过 App 内“设置 › 联系我们”与我们联系。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you have any questions about privacy, reach us through Settings › Contact Us in the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "如果识别错了，可以在这里改正。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If this was detected wrongly, correct it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
