    "漫迹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹会自动识别景点和店铺。没认出来的景点，可以在这里选“景点”。名称和类型会应用到附近 150 米内的所有到访记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace recognizes sights and shops automatically. If a sight wasn't recognized, choose Sight here. The name and type apply to every visit within 150 m."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹可以从照片的拍摄地点，找出你去过的国家和城市，为它们一一盖上印章。只读取时间和地点，照片不会被上传。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace can find the countries and cities you've been to from where your photos were taken, and stamp each one. Only the time and place are read; photos are never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹在后台安静地记录你每天的轨迹，自动整理去过的地方、城市和国家。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace quietly records your daily routes in the background and organizes the places, cities and countries you visit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹没有自己的服务器。你的轨迹、到访地点、旅程、照片和备注只保存在你的设备上，并通过你自己的 iCloud 账户在你的设备之间同步。开发者无法看到、访问或导出这些数据。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace has no servers of its own. Your tracks, visits, trips, photos and notes are stored only on your devices and synced between them through your own iCloud account. The developer cannot see, access or export this data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹用你的位置来画出走过的路线、识别停留的地点。位置数据不会离开你的设备和 iCloud。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace uses your location to draw your routes and recognize where you stay. Your location never leaves your devices and iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点“更改”，在“位置”里选“始终”，锁屏或关掉 App 时也能继续记录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap Change, then choose Always under Location, so recording continues while your iPhone is locked or the app is closed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点一次到访，查看那一天的完整轨迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a visit to see that day's full tracks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
