    "只允许访问了部分照片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only some photos are shared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹只能看到你选中的照片，其他照片里的地方不会被找到。在“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 照片”里把漫迹改成“完全访问”，回来再扫描一次即可补全。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace can only see the photos you selected, so places in the others won't be found. In Settings › Privacy & Security › Photos, set Waytrace to Full Access, then come back and scan again to fill in the rest."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从相册找回以前的旅程": {
