    "你": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你也共享给 Ta，你们就能看到彼此的平行足迹：哪天在同一座城市，在哪里擦肩而过。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share yours back and you'll both see your parallel footprints: the days you were in the same city, and where you passed each other."
