          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You were both near %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "你共享在 iCloud 里的足迹摘要会被删除，朋友们也看不到了。你自己的记录不受影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The footprint summary you share in iCloud will be deleted, and your friends will no longer see it. Your own records aren't affected."
