          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Footprints with %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和朋友互相共享足迹，看看你们哪天在同一座城市、在哪里擦肩而过、去过哪些同样的地方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share footprints with a friend and see the days you were in the same city, where you passed each other, and the places you've both been."
