          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "days in the same city"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家、公司、学校附近 2 公里内的一切，隐私区域，地点名称，具体坐标，路线，照片和文字。朋友算不出你住在哪里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anything within 2 km of home, work or school, your privacy zones, place names, exact coordinates, routes, photos and notes. Friends can't work out where you live."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已邀请，等待接受": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invited, waiting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平行足迹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parallel Footprints"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "擦肩而过": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passed each other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "朋友": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Friends"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "朋友就是你发出邀请、并且接受了的人。双方都共享之后，才能看到彼此的平行足迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Friends are the people you invite who accept. You both need to share before either of you sees your parallel footprints."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "次擦肩而过": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "times you passed each other"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在比对你们的足迹…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comparing your footprints…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每天到过哪些区域（约 20 公里的范围），以及每个小时所在的约 1 公里的方格。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which areas you were in each day (about 20 km across), and which square of about 1 km you were in each hour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹 · 平行足迹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace · Parallel Footprints"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等 Ta 共享回来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waiting for them to share"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "网络不可用，稍后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network isn't available. Try again later."
