    "邀请朋友": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Invite a Friend"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "随时停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop any time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要登录 iCloud 才能使用平行足迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to iCloud to use Parallel Footprints."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和你邀请的朋友互相共享足迹摘要，看看你们在哪里交汇。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Share a footprint summary with friends you invite and see where you crossed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 不包含广告、数据分析或第三方追踪 SDK，不会出售或共享你的任何数据；唯一的例外是你在“平行足迹”中主动共享给朋友的足迹摘要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app has no ads, analytics or third-party tracking SDKs, and never sells or shares any of your data; the only exception is the footprint summary you choose to share with friends in Parallel Footprints."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "沿途 %lld 站": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld stops along the way"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "相当于到第 %lld 站": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
