          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下一站": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再走 %@ 到%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ more to %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂停结束了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your pause is over"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开漫迹，继续记录你的足迹。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Waytrace to keep recording your footprints."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有当你在“平行足迹”中邀请朋友并同意共享时，App 才会把一份足迹摘要保存在你自己的 iCloud 中，并通过一个邀请链接共享出去，拿到链接的人可以接受（请只发给你想邀请的人）；双方都共享之后才会在 App 里互相看到。共享的内容是：每天到过的大致区域（约 20 公里）和每小时所在的约 1 公里方格。家、公司、学校附近 2 公里内的一切、隐私区域、地点名称、具体坐标、路线、照片和文字都不会共享。比对在各自的手机上进行，不经过任何服务器。你可以随时停止共享，摘要会从 iCloud 删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only if you invite a friend in Parallel Footprints and agree to share, the app keeps a footprint summary in your own iCloud and shares it through an invitation link that whoever has it can accept (send it only to people you mean to invite); you see each other in the app only once both have shared. What it shares: the rough areas you were in each day (about 20 km) and the square of about 1 km you were in each hour. Nothing within 2 km of home, work or school, your privacy zones, place names, exact coordinates, routes, photos or notes are shared. The comparing happens on each phone, never on a server. You can stop sharing at any time, and the summary is deleted from iCloud."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "摘要存在你自己的 iCloud 里。邀请是一个链接，拿到的人可以接受，所以请只发给你想邀请的人；双方都共享之后，你们才会在漫迹里互相看到。比对在各自的手机上进行，不经过我们的服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The summary is kept in your own iCloud. The invitation is a link that whoever has it can accept, so send it only to people you mean to invite; you see each other in Waytrace only once both have shared. The comparing happens on each phone, never on a server of ours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "漫迹 · 平行足迹邀请": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Waytrace · Parallel Footprints invitation"
