    },
    "用相机对准护照上的签证页，就能自动读出国家、类型和有效期。哪张快到期、还能停留多久，一眼就知道，到期前也会提醒你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Point the camera at a visa page in your passport and its country, type and dates are read for you. See at a glance which ones are running out and how long you can still stay, with a reminder before each expires."
          }
        }
      }
    },
