      }
    },
    "你在“签证夹”里添加的护照和签证信息（国家、类型、号码、姓名、日期等）只保存在这台设备和你自己的 iCloud 中，用来显示有效期和提醒你，不会共享给任何人，包括“平行足迹”里的朋友。扫描签证时，相机画面和照片只在手机上用来识别文字，不会保存或上传。你可以随时在签证夹里删除它们。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The passport and visa details you add to the Visa Wallet (country, type, number, name and dates) are kept only on this device and in your own iCloud, to show how long each is valid and remind you before it runs out. They are never shared with anyone, including friends in Parallel Footprints. When you scan a visa, the camera picture and photos are used on your iPhone only to read the text; they are never saved or uploaded. You can delete them in the Visa Wallet at any time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
